* HD graphics with Retina support;
* easy access to all commands;
* detailed instructions;
* playable for everybody and anybody! Fun for all ages! A must for any fan of simulation/strategy/space games and movies!
* expressly and exclusively designed for the iPad with use of the finger touch features to control the game.


